# .protectedpaths
#
# Paths that must NEVER be overwritten by a shared submodule update.
# These are business-specific and live in the parent repo — they are
# structurally protected (git submodule update only touches shared/).
#
# This file is read by scripts/update_shared.sh for pre-update validation.
#
# Format: one glob per line, relative to the business repo root.
# Lines starting with # are comments.

# Branding assets (colors, images, config)
*/branding/
branding/

# Business-specific logic
*/custom/

# Firebase credentials (never committed — listed here for documentation)
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
*.jks
*.keystore

# App-layer pubspec files (business controls their own deps)
customer_app/pubspec.yaml
delivery_app/pubspec.yaml
admin_app/pubspec.yaml

# Business README
README.md
